@host = http://localhost:5181

### Customers. The inherited repository loads the whole graph, then this filters in memory.
GET {{host}}/customers?search=aroha
Accept: application/json

### Products
GET {{host}}/products
Accept: application/json

### Orders already in the database
GET {{host}}/orders
Accept: application/json

### Place an order for Aroha (customer 1). Watch the console: UPDATE Customers is saved with the order.
POST {{host}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "customerId": 1,
  "lines": [
    { "productId": 1, "quantity": 2 }
  ]
}

### Rename by loading the entity and calling SaveChanges.
PATCH {{host}}/customers/2
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "name": "Nikau Rangi"
}
